```plantuml
@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle stickman

actor "普通用户" as User

rectangle "回看模块" {
  usecase "查看已解锁记录详情" as UC1
  usecase "查看当时元信息" as UC2
  usecase "进行当时与现在对照" as UC3
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC1 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
@enduml
```